\`\`\`{exercise} Question 1: What does CDO stand for? :label:
q-introduction-1

A. Climate Data Operators \
B. Climate Database Organizer \
C. Comprehensive Data Output \
D. Coordinated Data Operations

````

```{solution} q-introduction-1
A. Climate Data Operators
````

