````

\`\`\`{exercise} Question 3: Which ECMWF reanalysis product has the
highest spatial resolution? :label: q-introduction-3

A. ERA-Interim \
B. ERA5 \
C. ERA-20C \
D. ERA-40

````

```{solution} q-introduction-3
